 a shocked and surprised expression. This will be a reference to the surprised pikachu meme: https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcRuQQosQxVB6JHpNG_hjFiB8Nyozb082MyZIQ&s\n2. Second emoji: Doro doing a side eye. This will be a reference to the side eye meme, which features a monkey puppet doing a side eye: https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcSb8bOcXdgQC8Pj5HFzR-eNbzbBsBFt_VM_xw&s\n3. Third emoji: Doro with a confused expression. This will be a reference to the huh cat meme: https://ih1.redbubble.net/image.5539340709.3875/bg,f8f8f8-flat,750x,075,f-pad,750x1000,f8f8f8.jpg\n\nPlease let me know on X or Discord if you have further questions! Looking forward to hearing from you!", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 33022, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "\u864e\u767d(kohaku)@\u82b1\u7c89\u75c7/\u25b6\u95a2\u3051\u308211 J-68/\u25b6\u91ce\u90ce\u30d5\u30a7\u30b9-summer-", "screen_name": "T_kohaku2016", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1364056892696186881/rIzC9Tn6.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2878269722/1767030305/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 49}, {"id": 40266, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "\u3046\u3082\u3046", "screen_name": "milight_", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1547126973197332481/n4o-wRZE.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/973415838064652293/1602933313/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": nul